{"id":"abdabeb50455fed9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-readoncefunc.md","title":"Read-once Boolean function","display":"df-readoncefunc — Read-once Boolean function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-readoncefunc","aliases":["27-df-readoncefunc"],"display":"df-readoncefunc — Read-once Boolean function","depends_on":["[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","[[27-df-boolexpr]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.1 introduction; §10.3 positive-expression convention","source_printed_pages":"448,456","source_pdf_pages":"472,480","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-local-at-most-once-and-constant-extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-readoncefunc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-readoncefunc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-readoncefunc — Read-once Boolean function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.1 introduction; §10.3 positive-expression convention"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"448,456"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"472,480"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-local-at-most-once-and-constant-extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §10.1（印刷 p.448／PDF p.472）先允许 conjunction、disjunction、negation，再以翻转负变量的方式转入正函数研究；§10.3（印刷 p.456／PDF p.480）明确后续正函数约定。本目录分别命名带符号的一般类与正类，避免把变量翻转后的函数等同于原来的函数。</li>\n<li>常量及虚变量沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a> 的至多一次约定；正类与一般类中的正函数相同，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f98fb2ec31a9f521\" href=\"?note=f98fb2ec31a9f521\" title=\"27-thm-readoncepositive\">27-thm-readoncepositive</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]，$\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]，$\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"常量及虚变量沿用 [[27-df-readonceexpr]] 的至多一次约定；正类与一般类中的正函数相同，见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-readoncepositive","status":"resolved","id":"f98fb2ec31a9f521","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"常量及虚变量沿用 [[27-df-readonceexpr]] 的至多一次约定；正类与一般类中的正函数相同，见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1778,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffb2e1b071d703fb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb B^3\\to\\mathbb B$ 由 $f(x)=x_1x_2\\vee x_1x_3\\vee x_2x_3$、$g(x)=x_1x_2x_3$ 定义。$G(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_3$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_3$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]。 识别判据见 [[27-thm-readoncegraph]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-readoncefunc|df-readoncefunc — Read-once Boolean function]]"},{"id":"2258152dd7a3f9d8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]，其正部分接口见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。"},{"id":"5b42b5bd5b357f2f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$(T,\\lambda,\\ell,V)$ 满足 [[27-df-cotree]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$，$\\varnothing\\ne V\\subseteq[n]$，$A_\\epsilon:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $\\Gamma_T$ 取该定义。$\\mathcal M,G,\\math